  "details": "Let me post content to VRChat and serve that content in such a way that allows me to manage the selling/gifting of keys to people via an external merchant system, on a per user basis, for access to my licensed works and content.\nif someone is using my licensed content please don't cache it to other peoples hard drives to prevent asset stealing.\nthis system could be akin to that of youtubes DMCA system;\nauthors Uploading their original master copy and using that as proof of oringality and ownership of copyright for their works/content.\nitemized hashing of each component in user-generated content ie. sub-meshes, textures could prevent unauthorized derivatives and works that fall outside of fair use.\n-another system to encourage a higher quality of content and foster larger communities and projects I would hope.",
